    "updated_at": "2019-11-11T08:13:10Z",
    "body": "I've started on this and have something basically working here: https://github.com/lzybkr/starship/tree/powerline though based on the discussion in #624, I'll hold off on a PR because a change to prefix/suffix would definitely impact my changes - but in a good way.\r\n\r\nTo use my branch, your config file might look like:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndefault_suffix = \"\"\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\nstyle = \"fg:black bg:#dda0dd\"\r\ntruncate_to_repo = false\r\n\r\n[git_branch]\r\nstyle = \"fg:black bg:yellow\"\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nstyle = \"fg:red bg:yellow\"\r\n\r\n[package]\r\nstyle = \"fg:black bg:#f0fff0\"\r\n\r\n[rust]\r\nstyle = \"fg:black bg:#ffa07a\"\r\n\r\n[cmd_duration]\r\nstyle = \"fg:white bg:#191970\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd you'll get a prompt like this:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2148248/68571472-ede22080-0417-11ea-9946-2c13d205eb18.png)\r\n",
