    "body": "Did a little experiment and i sort of got it working for one element.\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[time]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nformat = \"[🕙 $time](bg:yellow fg:black)[](fg:yellow bg:black)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2271740/95118667-fc7da880-074a-11eb-807e-967fde2ac1c9.png)\r\n\r\nNot sure I want to do that level of manual format configuration for all modules though. Maybe I've just not figured out how to use it properly.",
