    "body": "i have a working configuration that displays this\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6325757/95685306-478a3680-0bf7-11eb-8949-9cb3252049b8.png)\r\n\r\nyou can check the configuration here :\r\nhttps://gitlab.com/pinage404/dotfiles/-/blob/ed455db5/dotfiles/config/starship.toml\r\n\r\nas you can see, it's really verbose to have simple separator character\r\n\r\ni didn't succeed to have a configuration that use powerline characters for each modules : each modules is displayed depending on the environnement, so i can't guess what is the previous color to have a continuous coloring bar\r\n\r\ni use FiraCode patched with [NerdFonts](https://www.nerdfonts.com/)",
