    "created_at": "2022-04-16T03:50:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-04-16T03:50:16Z",
    "body": "> or even better a $prev/next.style variable to just get the adjacent module style.\r\n\r\nThis option is definitely more flexible. I migrated from *Powerlevel10k*.\r\n\r\nMy theme is a simpler version of the *Powerline* prompt. It just has a `▶` character on the right. This needs to be styled using the previous part of the prompt. The previous part isn't known in advance.",
